[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1680.47, "timestamp": "00:28:00", "text": "我其实不知道该怎么处理我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1683.95, "timestamp": "00:28:03", "text": "推特账号。实际上，我搞砸了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1686.87, "timestamp": "00:28:06", "text": "向上。现在人们可能会这样想："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1690.99, "timestamp": "00:28:10", "text": "“哦，乔真是太自私了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1693.71, "timestamp": "00:28:13", "text": "某种东西。” 实际上，并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1696.47, "timestamp": "00:28:16", "text": "那。我只是在追随更大的潮流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1698.669, "timestamp": "00:28:18", "text": "创作者的东西。我一直在关注"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1701.07, "timestamp": "00:28:21", "text": "格式。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1703.789, "timestamp": "00:28:23", "text": "喜欢，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1706.87, "timestamp": "00:28:26", "text": "“上帝啊，如果事情真像事情发展的那样就好了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1707.789, "timestamp": "00:28:27", "text": "道路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1711.35, "timestamp": "00:28:31", "text": "我，它本该去的，我会，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1713.87, "timestamp": "00:28:33", "text": "不用担心这个问题，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1717.35, "timestamp": "00:28:37", "text": "现在。看着我。事情进展不顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1720.95, "timestamp": "00:28:40", "text": "我这么做就是因为这个原因。” 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1723.029, "timestamp": "00:28:43", "text": "就像它本该是主要内容一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1726.47, "timestamp": "00:28:46", "text": "帐户。我当时想，我就跟着做吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1729.75, "timestamp": "00:28:49", "text": "创建嗯，我正在密切合作的人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1732.95, "timestamp": "00:28:52", "text": "以及所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1737.669, "timestamp": "00:28:57", "text": "嗯，还有一些其他的东西。所以我就想，好吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1739.07, "timestamp": "00:28:59", "text": "比如……"}]